Package: gamepi-controllers
Version: 0.1.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Gamepi <archie2x@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, bluez, pipewire-bin, util-linux, systemd, init-system-helpers
Description: Gamepi Bluetooth controller pairing and power-button service
 Supplies gamepi-controller-pair, which reconnects or pairs 8BitDo pads in
 Switch mode on the USB Bluetooth adapter, and a service that turns a short
 press of the Raspberry Pi power button into a 30 second pairing window and
 a two second hold into a shutdown.
